WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.767
Keep the lecture in view.

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:06.100
Let the build finish, even when you close the lid.

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:09.800
LidPilot puts those choices right in your Mac’s menu bar.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.400
Keep Screen On for lectures, reading, and focused work.

00:00:13.833 --> 00:00:17.733
Keep Mac Running for builds, downloads, or a local AI task.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:20.600
Or let Follow Lid connect the two.

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:22.700
Choose how long you need it.

00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:24.733
Stop whenever you want.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:26.600
Native to macOS.

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:28.300
Free and open source.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:32.467
Install with Homebrew, or download it from lidpilot.app.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.300
LidPilot.

00:00:34.433 --> 00:00:36.600
Your Mac, on your time.
